  "releaseNotes": "## Patch notes for 149.0.187\n\nThese patch notes summarize the changes from version 148.0.136.\n\nAdded 13 new endpoints:\n* HourlyRate.CreateHourlyRate\n* HourlyRate.GetHourlyRates\n* HourlyRate.UpdateHourlyRate\n* HourlyRate.GetHourlyRate\n* HourlyRate.DeleteHourlyRate\n* HourlyRate.UpdateHourlyRateValue\n* HourlyRatePeriod.GetRatePeriods\n* HourlyRatePeriod.CreateRatePeriod\n* Risk.GetRisk\n* Risk.UpdateRisk\n* Risk.RemoveRisk\n* Risk.GetRisksForProject\n* Risk.CreateRisk\n\nChanges to data models:\n* MeetingDetailsDto: Added new field `project`\n* MeetingDto: Added new field `project`\n* RiskDto: Changed the data type of the field `assignments` from `AssignmentDto` to `RiskAssignmentDto`\n* RiskDto: Added new field `project`",
